{"id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fibred-finite-products.md","title":"纤维有限积","display":"df-fibred-finite-products — 纤维有限积","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","display":"df-fibred-finite-products — 纤维有限积","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-substitution]]","[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]"],"source":"§1.8, especially fibrewise characterisation of fibred finite products","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-fibred-finite-products"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fibred-finite-products"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibred-finite-products — 纤维有限积"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b663a0efd45aead\" href=\"?note=8b663a0efd45aead\" title=\"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor\">16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§1.8, especially fibrewise characterisation of fibred finite products"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fibred-finite-products</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b663a0efd45aead\" href=\"?note=8b663a0efd45aead\" title=\"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor\">16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</a>，其源范畴和值域由此处已声明的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\)</span> 在下文定义。有限积的保持按终对象及积投影诱导的规范比较表达，不预先假设待断言的纤维终对象或积已被选出。</li>\n<li>末式仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\)</span> 成立并选定各纤维有限积后使用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_I\">\\(1_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times_IY\">\\(X\\times_IY\\)</span> 是该选择的终对象、二元积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_I,\\wedge_I\">\\(\\top_I,\\wedge_I\\)</span> 由末式给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\\n\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\\n\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top_I\\coloneqq1_I,\\qquad X\\wedge_IY\\coloneqq X\\times_IY.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top_I\\coloneqq1_I,\\qquad X\\wedge_IY\\coloneqq X\\times_IY.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>选定纤维终对象和积后，保持性要求唯一比较 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*1_J\\to1_I\">\\(u^*1_J\\to1_I\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u^*\\pi_1,u^*\\pi_2\\rangle:u^*(X\\times_JY)\\to u^*X\\times_Iu^*Y\">\\(\\langle u^*\\pi_1,u^*\\pi_2\\rangle:u^*(X\\times_JY)\\to u^*X\\times_Iu^*Y\\)</span> 可逆。它们的完整定义在保有限积函子原子内。</li>\n<li>每个纤维的存在性与重索引的保持性分别断言，更换积的选择给出等价条件。预序纤维中，终对象、积分别记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_I,\\wedge_I\">\\(\\top_I,\\wedge_I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, §1.8 的 fibrewise characterisation；Definition 4.2.1, p. 233（PDF 第 253 页）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor","status":"resolved","id":"8b663a0efd45aead","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 沿 $u:I\\to J$，采用 [[16-df-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinProd}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]；$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]，其源范畴和值域由此处已声明的 $F$ 固定。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor","status":"resolved","id":"8b663a0efd45aead","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinProd}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]；$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]，其源范畴和值域由此处已声明的 $F$ 固定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"1_I","display":false},{"tex":"X\\times_IY","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_I,\\wedge_I","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\\n\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\top_I\\coloneqq1_I,\\qquad X\\wedge_IY\\coloneqq X\\times_IY.","display":true},{"tex":"u^*1_J\\to1_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u^*\\pi_1,u^*\\pi_2\\rangle:u^*(X\\times_JY)\\to u^*X\\times_Iu^*Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_I,\\wedge_I","display":false}],"bytes":2188,"backlinks":[{"id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；预序、纤维有限积、简单等式分别见 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-eq-functor]]。"},{"id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]。"},{"id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 沿 $u:I\\to J$。$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}$、纤维积及其保持性采用 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$、指数及评价箭头采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。"},{"id":"ac2effb31369eeeb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 是带提升选择的纤维化，具有指定的纤维有限积及保积重索引，见 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]。$u:I\\to J$ 为基箭头，$L:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J$ 是候选函子，$\\Phi$ 是候选 Hom 映射族。"},{"id":"c8e5d73279cd6c19","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]；$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]。它同时要求各纤维有限积存在及重索引保持其规范积比较。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]、[[16-df-nno]]、[[16-df-fibre]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"},{"id":"c4ad19a65f2d8802","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinProd}$、$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}$、$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]；其源靶范畴均取当前函子的已声明类型。"},{"id":"4d7b1b6f9345e344","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_I\\times\\mathcal E_I$ 使用 [[16-thm-product-sum-adjoint]] 的六元组积范畴。$\\Delta_I,\\sqcup_I,\\sqcap_I$ 的两个分量由下式定义；$X,Y,X',Y'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I$，$f:X\\to X',g:Y\\to Y'$ 为垂直箭头。$X\\vee_IY,X\\wedge_IY$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]] 的同一选择；预序性保证末两项单元素集合的唯一性。$\\dashv_\\epsilon$ 采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。"}],"outgoing":["c9801f31ec8ac53f","b75e7c168ac56b22","ccfbb871fa39931c","8b663a0efd45aead"]}